    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara is pleased to present 120 Harold’s Cross Cottages to the open market. A unique double fronted cottage tucked away in this quiet residential enclave. No. 120 has been thoughtfully laid out to maximise space and light offering a practical, low-maintenance home within easy reach of the city centre.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises open-plan dining/kitchen with range of fitted units, 1 1/3 sink unit. Stairs to bathroom with rainfall shower, w.c., whb. Livingroom with insert fireplace and Velux windows. Bedroom with door to tiled courtyard.\r\n\r\nThe location of Harold’s Cross Cottages cannot be understated. Nestled among a quiet cluster of artisan homes, the property is within walking distance of Dublin city centre, with the vibrant villages of Harold’s Cross, Terenure, and Rathmines also nearby. The surrounding area offers an abundance of amenities, from independent shops and specialist retailers to an array of cultural, culinary, and leisure destinations. Outdoor enthusiasts will appreciate the proximity to picturesque canal walks and the green open spaces of Harold’s Cross Park. Public transport options are excellent with multiple bus routes serving the area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Open-plan Living/Kitchen/Dining\r\nKitchen/Dining\r\nRange of fitted units, 1 1/3 sink unit. Part-tiled. Recessed lights, shutters. Utility press, plumbed for washer/dryer, C.H. Boiler, Storage. \r\n\r\nLivingroom\r\nFitted shelving. Insert fireplace. Velux windows. Shutters.\r\n\r\nBedroom\r\nRecessed lights. Door to tiled courtyard.\r\n\r\nStairs to:\r\nLanding\r\nHot-press\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nTiled floor, w.c.,whb. Medicine cabinet. Extractor. Rainfall shower with telephone shower attachment. Tiled. Velux window.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nTiled courtyard to rear. On-street disc parking to front."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Bright open-plan Living/Kitchen/Dining\r\nGFCH\r\nQuiet residential setting\r\nLow maintenance courtyard\r\nOn-street disc parking \r\nWalking distance to Harold’s Cross, Terenure, Rathmines villages\r\nConvenient to Bus routes, M50, City Centre"
      },
      {
